\newlabel{fig:system}{{3}{5}{\textbf {System shape.} Audio chunks pass an energy gate; the merged LoRA model transcribes the current bounded segment with the \ctx {} prefix in the system slot and may emit marker tokens; two policy knobs sit behind the model. Outputs are transcript segments plus END events, the same event shape as Flux's \texttt {EagerEndOfTurn}.\relax }{figure.caption.4}{}}
